<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "2000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田外道路.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Once again we headed for the Arata settlement on the buggy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I'd had an intuition so intense I could feel it with my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart was still pounding.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One more time... I'll go back over it carefully one more time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "盗視.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n150\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n150\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The first thing I saw was a cave, probably somewhere in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> must have been inside that cave.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That place is a very dangerous―<PG>
No, that's not it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On reflex I told <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, 'It's dangerous, get away from there,' but thinking back carefully, I never saw <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> herself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I remember right―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎幽霊バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ白.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺幻影.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There was a man, and a woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in front of the two of them, a suspicious-looking <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that, the woman ended up covered in blood―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The man looked vaguely familiar...<PG>
Probably <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't recognize the woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A woman at <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>'s side, then... could that have been <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>?<PG>
As I thought, it was clearly different from my intuitions until now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than foreseeing danger to <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, I had seen <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> had already died 10 years ago, so...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I'd just seen felt old, if anything.<PG>
Something like an event in 'the past.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It felt as if I'd seen something that happened there in the past.<PG>
The feeling that it's a dangerous place now... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hmm... maybe it was a little different from that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's vague even to me, but if I had to put it in a word, maybe 'a place where there was danger.'<PG>
―<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had said it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'No matter what, we reach <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> so easily that it's actually strange.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I wanted to argue against that, it would be with 'where there's smoke, there's fire.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> isn't the culprit, he probably has some connection.<PG>
That suspicious-looking <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
A blood-soaked <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On my own, I'd have a hard time examining that and working out an answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without a doubt, this is something I should talk over with <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
No... before that, maybe I should ask Shirozaki-san...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it was something that happened in the past, he might know something.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "2000" "WAIT"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田外道路.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Excuse me! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouted so the buggy's engine wouldn't drown out my voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
What is it!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a slight pause, his voice came back.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"When I called </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> earlier, she said she was 'in a secret place.' Do you have any idea where that might be!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A secret place...?
{PAUSE ""}
　No... I can't really say from just that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I guess that's true. If it's a secret place, maybe even the residents don't know about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though it's also possible Shirozaki-san is playing dumb―<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then do you recognize a tripod like the ones you use in science experiments, and a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With something this specific, he might take it for a witch's power instead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if so, that's fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to draw out any information, however little, that <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> can use for her analysis.<PG>
"Oh, I know those!
{PAUSE ""}
　They're ritual implements we use at memorial services! You'll probably see them tomorrow!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ritual implements used at memorial services...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What were <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> doing, taking those out?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"How are those ritual implements used at the memorial service?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"How do I put it... it's like offering incense. 
{PAUSE ""}
The mourners just pour a little liquid into the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>. Tomorrow, just copy everyone else and it'll be easy."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Can just anyone take that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> out?"</STYLE><PG>
"Hmm, hard to say... 
{PAUSE ""}
Basically, only whoever holds the post of 'witch' can touch it, but I guess anyone could take it out if they wanted to. 
{PAUSE ""}
But if you only wanted to use a <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>, I don't see any need to go to the trouble of taking out the ritual implements..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's hard to say anything for sure...<PG>
So does that mean the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE> used as a ritual implement isn't anything special either?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, Shirozaki-san is being awfully talkative...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does that mean he'll answer plain questions, as long as they don't involve my premonitions?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Uh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> had a witch's power―the danger-sense ability, didn't she?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Since when?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, about that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But this is something everyone knows, right? Isn't it okay for me to know that much too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Shirozaki-san stopped the buggy.
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田駅夜外.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Was this a station?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was probably Arata Station, where we'd originally planned to meet up with <STYLE ID="8">Obasan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no one around at all, not even a streetlight.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"You know what that is?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田駅資材倉庫夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What Shirozaki-san pointed at was something like a shed, like a small storehouse―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least, it wasn't anyone's home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could this be the storage shed they'd mentioned?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\door_old1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田駅資材倉庫中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I tried opening the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inside were lumber, blue tarps and other things you'd expect in a storage shed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE> and Mom had meant to spend the night in a place like this...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田駅資材倉庫夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, does this place have something to do with it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Today...
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
there was an oracle..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An oracle...? Suddenly the talk was turning occult again.<PG>
"That today, the curse-killer would be lurking here... that's what it said."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\恐怖BGM2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
The blood drained from my face all at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means... 
{PAUSE ""}
someone tipped them off that <STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Mom</STYLE> are the culprits!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Sorry, could you tell me a little more...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Let's get a little away from here. If the curse-killer shows up, we're in danger too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Shirozaki-san got on the buggy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Judging from this, Shirozaki-san must believe in this so-called oracle too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
It still didn't <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="ふ">sit</STYLE> right with me, but I got on the buggy too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "2000" "WAIT"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜バギー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what do you mean!? The culprit, there...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know. Even if someone does come, they probably won't be the culprit. 
{PAUSE ""}
An oracle... something like that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh...? He was saying the opposite of what he'd said before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki-san doesn't believe in the oracle...?<PG>
I was losing track of what was going on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least, there's someone out there who has <STYLE ID="9">my dad</STYLE> and mom pegged as the culprits.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I can't believe Shirozaki-san said 'oracle' as a joke...<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Who is it!? The person who gave that oracle!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
